# Power Tools (formerly the bundled "uefn-bridge") is now an independent
# repo (Corsair-Studios/trashbyrds-uefn-power-tools) publishing its own
# GitHub Releases. It installs on demand at runtime via
# src/host/vscode/powerToolsInstall.ts (resolvePowerToolsDir /
# installPowerTools) into <globalStorage>/powertools, rather than shipping
# inside this VSIX. Exclude the whole directory so it never ships, even if
# it's ever repopulated locally for dev/testing.
media/uefn-bridge/**
